{"id":"en_twenty-twenty","title":"Twenty-Twenty","titleEn":"Twenty-Twenty","description":"At twenty, Dahee finds none of the fresh start that adulthood is supposed to bring. She remains stuck in her mother's shadow, and rebellious thoughts keep rising from somewhere deep inside her: the wish to live as herself rather than simply as her mother's daughter. She is only one step away from leaving the fence behind, and now, having just come of age, Dahee begins to summon the courage to take that step. The series Twenty-Twenty can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/38d4dfd6bdb5db44/ko_KR/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/38d4dfd6bdb5db44/ko_KR/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["성인식","캠퍼스 커플","우연으로","로맨스","달콤한 로맨스","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdo6g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_twenty-twenty_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdo6g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_twenty-twenty_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdo6g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_twenty-twenty_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdo6g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_twenty-twenty_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdo6g/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_twenty-twenty_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD